multilingual_responses
  response response_external_benchmark_learning_task_en
    intent external_benchmark_learning_task
    language en
    text "Use Formal AI auto-learning to inspect the persisted issue 698 external benchmark failures as an associative links network, rank the evidence and general evaluator-boundary amendments, keep promotion human-review gated, and write external-benchmark-learning-report.lino."
  response response_external_benchmark_learning_task_ru
    intent external_benchmark_learning_task
    language ru
    text "Используй автообучение Formal AI, чтобы изучить сохранённые сбои внешних бенчмарков issue 698 как ассоциативную сеть связей, ранжировать доказательства и общие поправки на границе оценщика, оставить продвижение за проверкой человека и записать external-benchmark-learning-report.lino."
  response response_external_benchmark_learning_task_hi
    intent external_benchmark_learning_task
    language hi
    text "Formal AI auto-learning का उपयोग करके issue 698 की सहेजी गई external benchmark विफलताओं को associative links network के रूप में जाँचें, सबूतों और सामान्य evaluator-boundary संशोधनों को rank करें, promotion को मानव समीक्षा के पीछे रखें, और external-benchmark-learning-report.lino लिखें।"
  response response_external_benchmark_learning_task_zh
